# The image is assembled from the Next.js standalone output built outside
# Docker. Ignore everything else so stray files, such as the development .env,
# never enter the context or bust the layer cache, then re-include what the
# Dockerfile copies. The /** lines are required because re-including a
# directory does not re-include its contents (moby/moby#30018).
*
!.next
.next/*
!.next/standalone
!.next/standalone/**
!.next/static
!.next/static/**
